@title Learn: the early-access line is on the path, topic and search pages, not only the home
@area Learn
# R4 on the Learn round 25 PR: with the per-lesson tag gone, only the home said lessons are early access.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text learn
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
text motor
wait 10
shot search-results
expect "Lessons are early access"
# S4 findings here are the dialog standing over the dock (on purpose).
check_layout
click_text "Clear search and level"
wait 6
click_text "First hour"
wait 10
shot path-page
expect "Lessons are early access"
